{"id":"wb-2-23","name":"岩山寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"岩山寺","text":"岩山寺，又称灵岩寺，位于山西繁峙县南峪口五台山北麓。全国重点文物保护单位。\n该寺创建于金正隆三年（1158年），元朝、明朝、清朝屡有修葺。该寺布局坐北朝南，现存文殊殿、伽蓝殿、地藏殿、马王殿、禅房、垂花门等。文殊殿为金代建筑。四周壁画出自金代宫廷画师王逵之手。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B2%A9%E5%B1%B1%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":86783359,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783359","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/0584fcfc530cef55ef22784a.jpg","title":"Yanshan_Temple,_Fanshi,_2020-09-07_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yanshan_Temple,_Fanshi,_2020-09-07_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/Yanshan_Temple%2C_Fanshi%2C_2020-09-07_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​山西繁峙天岩岩山寺","width":320,"height":214}}